WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:28.480
People are dying one by one.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:32.640
Leclan of the Earth Union Military,
 who cooperated with the Solo Ship...

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:41.290
The Buff Clan commander Rukuku Kil who faced 
the wrath of Harulu, and her assassin Kulara...

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:50.450
And last, Moera of the Ideon's crew
 also vanished into the stardust.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:56.740
Has the power of Ide begun
 to demand blood sacrifices?

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:04.360
<b>Waft Area Gamble</b>

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:33.820
Bes...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.900
I know nothing can bring him back, but...

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.040
Rapoh... Is this about Moera?

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:00.030
I'm sorry, Rapoh.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:01.740
Cosmo...

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.850
Has our fate been sealed?

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.080
Because of the "Ide"?

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:18.240
We can still change it, that's
 what everyone is fighting for.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.780
The Logo Dau aliens' ship is
 moving at a steady speed.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.320
Okay, keep us at this distance.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.120
Yes sir!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.020
Commander!

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.520
Mebarul Kuou, huh...

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:54.450
Are you sure about this? The Logo Dau
 aliens are about to escape even further...

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.480
I know.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.030
We'll lose our advantage if we keep waiting
 for Supreme Commander Doba's orders.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:03.660
For the sake of our forces, wouldn't
 it be better to stop them here?

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:11.110
Should we fail, you can hold me
 responsible for everything.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.760
Do you have a plan?

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:17.730
We could force them to enter the Waft
 Area you told me about, Sir Hannibal.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:19.490
Waft Area?

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.820
How do we drive them there?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.160
It's dangerous in there!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.230
Once you get taken in, you're never getting out!

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:25.730
Shut up!

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:27.900
Interesting.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.380
I'm not giving you permission,
 but this sounds interesting.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.220
Yes!

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.590
I'm against this!

00:04:55.590 --> 00:05:00.230
Having Gije pilot the Ideon in place
of Moera? I can handle it on my own!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.760
I understand how you feel,

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.890
but are you really up to the task, Kasha?

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.500
Sheryl!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.240
Why don't you act the way you used to?

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.610
You're being fooled by Gije!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.740
You're going too far, Kasha!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.610
We're not trying to fool anyone!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:17.570
"We"? If you call him one of us,
 you've already been fooled!

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:25.440
However, both the Solo Ship and
 Ideon need his piloting abilities.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.190
That was Cosmo's opinion as well.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.170
You can't be serious! Cosmo!

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.960
That's what I said. I just feel that way.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.260
But still...

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.240
A righteous heart will invoke the power of the Ide...

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:38.770
I'm worried about that Buff Clan legend.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:42.140
But if we just work hard enough-

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:45.610
If Gije was planning to betray us, he
 would have done it a long time ago.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:48.180
I've had several chances...

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:52.050
Now that Bes has collapsed, 
we need all the talent we have.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:56.740
I'm asking you as well. Give Gije 
this chance to redeem himself.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.650
Hatari, what is it?

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:05.560
Sorry, Gije. Despite what I've said,
 I can't put all my faith in you yet.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:09.160
It's only reasonable that you don't trust me.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.670
It's not that we outright distrust you, though.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.260
This girl is tough. She will be observing you.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:23.090
If it looks like you are going to
betray us, she'll shoot you.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.800
I'll do all I can.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.550
Sheryl, Kasha, is this okay with you?

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.770
Thanks, Hatari.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.390
Hatari! Isn't that a bit one-sided?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.820
If Gije betrays us, you can put the blame on me.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:36.900
That's not it!

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:37.920
It's the alarm!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:41.530
Heavy Mobile Mecha have crossed the
second battle line! There's two of them!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.010
Reinforcements, huh?

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.430
Take care!

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.890
We'll be alright!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:56.080
Cosmo! Please instruct me!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:59.010
Check the main engine control
and start anti-air surveillance.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:06:59.880
Roger!

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:07.090
Cosmo, you trust Gije too much! I don't like this!

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:10.990
We need his piloting skills.
Try to be a bit more open-minded.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.560
When did you turn into a saint?

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.100
Lotta's watching you right now.
Don't try anything funny!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:20.900
Roger!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.670
You must feel uneasy about this, but I'm thrilled.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:28.330
I can finally see the light of the Ideon
Gauge shine inside the Giant.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.290
I want to believe your words.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:36.590
Lotta, if there's anything suspicious about me...

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:40.190
Don't hold back, shoot me 10 or
 20 times if that's what it takes.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.920
Right, that's what I intend.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.690
Sorry for being a burden.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.820
They're approaching us! 
Everyone, get in battle formation!

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:03.110
We've found them!

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.780
Roger! Switching to long distance view!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.560
It's those damn things they call Adigos!

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.080
Gije! Do you know what that Heavy
Mobile Mecha behind them is?

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.920
That mass and size... I don't know.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.360
It's an entirely new model.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.790
Okay. Let's dock and confront it! Kasha!

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.660
Roger! Gije, do you understand?

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.990
Docking formation!

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:21.510
Roger!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.840
Energy and power normal!

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.340
Ready to dock!

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.260
Do you know what to do?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.030
It's the Giant, no doubt about it!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.610
All right, rope them into the
 Waft Area as planned!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.000
Yes ma'am!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.270
Thirty units! I count thirty units!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.460
Roger!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.890
There's that many? Can we do it?

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.410
How should I know?

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:10.500
When you attacked us, I was never
 confident about our chances then either!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.540
I'm sorry.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:11.980
Incoming!

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.750
Those Adigos are fast!

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:25.190
However, the Giant's barrier is incredible! It's still up!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.160
Simultaneous Missile Attack!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:33.470
Damn the Adigo squadron!

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:35.040
They're attacking indiscriminately.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.670
They should attack from the left!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:37.340
Yes ma'am!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.240
We're near the Waft Area!

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.640
Let's pressure it there!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.550
They're coming from the right, Cosmo!

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:49.320
Let Gije handle them!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:01.860
What?

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:04.900
What is that?!

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.500
They've caught us?!

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.320
Damn it!

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:30.010
They're dragging the Ideon!

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:32.430
Do they think this is enough to take us down?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.430
Lotta! Don't avert your eyes!

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:37.830
I'm sorry!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:38.670
Are you alright?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.810
Yes.

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:41.070
Oh, that's...

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.100
Damn it, the Waft Area!

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.910
It was here all along?!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.930
Vent, Cosmo, Kasha!

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:51.650
Can we pull back? If we enter the Waft Area...

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.680
What's the Waft Area?
Can we pull back? If we enter the Waft Area...

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.050
It's a space with a massive 
number of mineral lifeforms.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.840
Once you go in, there's no getting out!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.880
Find a group of Vandes big
 enough to pull down the Giant!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.530
Lady Mebarul! Is this alright?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.670
Just be quick!

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.200
Gije! The rocks are moving!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:16.890
It's the Vandes!

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.350
Release the claws!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.770
Escape from the Waft Area!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.030
Why won't the power rise?

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:38.940
They've caught us!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:39.940
What?!

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:40.940
Are those the Vandes?

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:41.370
What?!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:52.110
No form of energy can escape the
 Waft Area once it has been sucked in!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:55.180
All right, the Vandes can finish off the Giant.

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.760
We'll attack the Logo Dau ship!

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:20.130
Waft Area! I remember! That's the Waft Area!

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:23.270
Waft Area? What's that?

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:24.440
Incoming enemy attack!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:25.120
Huh?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.680
Don't flinch!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.680
Anti-air fire! All cannons, fire
 arbitrarily at the enemy!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.000
What is the Ideon doing?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:47.230
There's nothing the Ideon can do
if the Vandes have caught it!

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:50.200
What are those Waft Area Vandes?

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.160
Stay still, Lou!

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:14.630
The barrier is falling apart!

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:17.020
The normal engine still has power!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.330
Can we escape?

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:20.260
I don't know the Giant
well enough to answer that!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.730
Which direction can we escape to?

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:27.200
Cosmo! The barrier's power is going down!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:31.940
Gije! Are these rocks multiplying by
 sucking up the barrier's energy?

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:32.820
They just keep coming!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:33.840
It can't be!

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.360
Is there nothing we can do?

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:40.360
Impossible, the Ide's power isn't that weak!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.040
Believe in the power that the Ideon holds!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.450
Are we done for, Cosmo?!

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.960
Don't panic, this is nothing!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.460
That's right, Deck! A true man fights to the end!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.530
You'd better sit down!

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:54.920
Yes!

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.880
The Ideon Gun's power is going up!

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:01.030
We didn't bring the Ideon Gun!

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.740
They're in front of us! Main cannon, fire!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:14.190
Ideon Swords! Cosmo! Switch the circuits!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.900
Roger! Gije, Vent, check the circuits!

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:18.290
Where are they?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.740
The lever on the lower right!

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:21.760
Accelerator active!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:23.990
Bionic condenser going up!

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.490
Roger! The Ide's flow is turning!

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.460
Mama!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:34.040
The Ide's power output is going up!

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.510
Okay, here goes! Ideon Swords!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:02.600
Incredible!

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.000
Have we been saved?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.630
This will save us!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.670
Lotta, Vent, this Ideon is incredible!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.660
It's clearly the manifestation of the Ide's power!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.670
The monitor is on!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.380
Current position confirmed!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:23.800
Move thirty degrees to the
 right for the target location!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:24.600
Roger!

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.020
The Giant? Did it escape from the Waft Area?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:37.760
Attack the Giant!

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:38.230
Yes ma'am!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.200
Using the same tactic is useless!

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:56.650
Ideon Swords! Go!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.500
We can't use the Swords?

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.230
The power has decreased drastically!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.990
We used too much power trying to escape!

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.660
I'll take a look, watch the controls.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:09.760
Lotta, don't take your eyes off him!

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:10.640
Yes!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.020
Got it!

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.230
Gije, don't shoot without permission-

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:21.510
That's right! We can't win without proper
 teamwork! Do what Kasha says!

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:22.570
Understood.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:31.790
Are you okay? Lotta! Gije! What happened?

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:32.450
Gije!

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:43.930
Cosmo!

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:45.340
The Waft Area is ahead!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:50.270
There's no other way! Dock out and escape!

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.540
Throw it into the Waft Area!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.420
No, you won't!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:19.970
The Vandes!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.470
We need to get out!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.210
They went too far!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:50.060
Will you fight a fellow Buff Clan soldier?

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.460
Right now, this might be my chance!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.350
I am Gije Zaral.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.380
I have seized one of the Giant machines!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:10.020
You bastard, you betrayed us!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:14.280
No matter how I try to open my heart to
 them, aliens cannot understand each other.

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:17.490
That's what I finally realized!
 I belong to the Buff Clan!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:18.730
Gije!

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:25.000
Gije, what's going on?

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.430
There was a slight intrusion, but I resolved it.

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.890
Very well, bring yourself here.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:30.670
Roger.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.310
Cosmo, what's going on?

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.170
How should I know?

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:39.330
Is Gije trying to betray us, Cosmo?

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.610
This is why I was against him!

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:45.320
No! This is the perfect opportunity
 to surround and beat them!

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:48.500
Roger!

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:50.490
Gije?!

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.620
Don't do it!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.940
Gije, you tricked us! Such underhanded tactics!

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:21.510
I must be a fool for trusting someone like Gije,
 who was already forsaken by Doba!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:26.430
Kasha! Fire the 13th block missiles and kick!

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.660
I know!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:41.520
Damn you, Gije! You traitor!

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:55.220
A young life wasted...

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.160
Lotta, what happened?

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.160
I don't really understand it.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.000
No matter what the end result was,

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:11.630
It seems obvious to me that
Gije was trying to run away.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:14.680
I can't help but to feel that way too.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:18.980
If he was planning to take down the
 enemy, he would have briefed us about it.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.350
Gije, what's the truth?

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.020
You're going to suspect me
 either way. I won't make excuses.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.520
He was going to run away with the Ideon!

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.920
Cosmo, what do you think?

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:34.280
I think he made the right
decision, based on our results.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.860
That's nonsense!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.600
Cosmo, aren't you in charge
 of the Ideon? Make up your mind!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.440
There's no way around it.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:50.280
Let's settle this for good. We'll flip a coin.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:50.940
A coin?

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:57.410
Heads, Gije's on our side. Tails...

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:59.290
You can't be serious!

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:01.360
You want to punish Gije then?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:06.130
Suspicion alone isn't grounds for punishment, but...

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:10.630
We're only human. Either way, this has to be settled.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:12.100
Yeah.

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:15.570
Tails means you're a traitor.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:18.030
Very well.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.670
Heads...

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:39.140
Gije.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:40.860
Are we going to...

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:46.200
Are we going to make such an important
 decision based on this? Cosmo!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.170
Answer me, Cosmo!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.390
Well, then...

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.500
Are you calling Gije a traitor, Kasha?

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:59.880
I trust him. At least for today, Gije Zaral...

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:11.920
At that moment, Gije thought to himself...

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:17.160
Was his true intention to return
 to the Buff Clan homeworld?

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:21.330
Or were his actions simply part of a plan?

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:25.370
Right now, he doesn't know himself...

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:53.800
<i>The mystery of the Ide only grows
deeper for the Solo Ship crew.</i>

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:58.270
<i>However, the Buff Clan is not giving
up on their pursuit of the Ide.</i>

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:03.780
<i>On a planet inhabitated by the fierce Domou
 beasts, the Ideon continues its bitter battle.</i>

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:08.920
<i>Will the screams of the Domou
 babies awaken the power of the Ide?</i>

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:12.350
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon,</i>

